From: Dmitri <dms202575p@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:26:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnostics: exit reasons, settings report, event journal;
 APK name as versionName

- Diagnostics window on start + file in Downloads: Android's recorded
  process exit reasons, Winlator background settings, Android restrictions
  and system state, device/profile/Knox info, matching system settings,
  lifecycle journal with a 5-minute heartbeat.
- versionName comes from -PapkVersionName (the APK file name in CI).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018cLUKUNDhFWb9gSFtJ7vW4
